{"id":33,"date":"2022-05-24T20:52:22","date_gmt":"2022-05-24T20:52:22","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/?page_id=33"},"modified":"2024-12-17T21:48:49","modified_gmt":"2024-12-17T21:48:49","slug":"home-partners","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/","title":{"rendered":"Home-Partners"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1>\n\t\tcustomer service is our #1 priority\n\t<\/h1>\n\t<p>Power10 was started out of a simple desire to bring an added level of customer service and support to our customers. We are excited to be\u00a0partnered\u00a0with manufacturers who make customer service a number one priority!<\/p>\n<h2>\n\t\tWHAT IS A POWER 10?\n\t<\/h2>\n\t<p>A Power 10 is a strategic rowing term. It is a call for all rowers to do ten of their best, most powerful strokes in order to pull ahead of the competition.<\/p>\n<h1>\n\t\tOUR PARTNERS\n\t<\/h1>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/gct.co\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" itemprop=\"url\">\n\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/gct_logo_500px-300x107.png\" alt=\"GCT Logo | Power10 Sales\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"107\" width=\"300\" title=\"gct_logo_500px\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 300px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 300\/107;\" \/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/gct_logo_500px-300x107.png\" alt=\"GCT Logo | Power10 Sales\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"107\" width=\"300\" title=\"gct_logo_500px\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"  \/><\/noscript>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ktptechs.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" itemprop=\"url\">\n\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/king-300x78.png\" alt=\"King Epoxy\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"78\" width=\"300\" title=\"king\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 300px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 300\/78;\" \/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/king-300x78.png\" alt=\"King Epoxy\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"78\" width=\"300\" title=\"king\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"  \/><\/noscript>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t<p>Global Connector Technology Limited (GCT) is a leading supplier of standard and custom interconnect products. Our focus is on the supply of reliable high-quality connectors and cable assemblies.\u00a0 GCT leverages extensive worldwide resources to meet customer needs at local, regional and global levels. We have well-established sales, product development and manufacturing facilities in Europe, Asia and the Americas; GCT can support you wherever you design-wherever you manufacture.<\/p>\n\t<p>King Epoxy Emblem (KTP) is a top manufacturer specializing in membrane switches, plastic injection molding, nameplates, in-mold decorative injection (IMD\/IML), and metal stamping. With a factory in Thailand, KTP serves North America with a wide array of products and services, including in-house design, engineering, customer support, warehousing, and assembly. Our commitment to quality and innovation ensures top-tier solutions for projects of any size across various industries.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/www.metalfx.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" itemprop=\"url\">\n\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/metal-fx-Hi-Res-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Metal Fx Logo | Power10 Sales\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"578\" width=\"2560\" title=\"metal fx Hi Res\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2560px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2560\/578;\" \/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/metal-fx-Hi-Res-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Metal Fx Logo | Power10 Sales\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"578\" width=\"2560\" title=\"metal fx Hi Res\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"  \/><\/noscript>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n<p>METALfx\u00a0was founded in 1976 as a precision sheet metal fabricator with a primary focus on networking equipment. Through the years,\u00a0METALfx\u00a0has diversified across many market sectors and now supplies vital parts and builds to industries such as food service, medical, semiconductor, and transportation. Our 125,000 square foot facility in in welcoming\u00a0Willits, CA, charmingly situated at that border between wine country and the redwoods is where we focus on key performance metrics and offer extensive in-house capabilities.<\/p>\n<p>Cut it, bend it, weld it, machine it, paint it, and assemble it. When it comes to precision sheet metal, METALfxwill do it all or just what you need. Our experienced engineers help to improve customer designs for manufacturability and offer prototype to production support. Piece by piece our ISO-certified facility carefully builds and inspects each project to ensure conformance to customer requirements. From small precision parts to large cabinets, small quantities to high-volume, we have the experienced team, facility, and technology to turn your concept into reality.<\/p>\n<h2>\n\t\tabout us\n\t<\/h2>\n\t<p>Power10 Sales is a manufacturers rep. firm located in the heart of Silicon Valley. We represent companies supporting the electronics industry; specifically, printed circuit boards, sheet metal and components. Power10 focuses on providing sales support to companies in the San Francisco Bay Area, Sacramento, CA and Southern CA. <a href=\"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/about-us\/\">Learn More<\/a><\/p>\n<h3>\n\t\tget in touch\n\t<\/h3>\n\t<p>650.224.3086<\/p>\n\t<p>ally@powertensales.com<\/p>\n<h3>\n\t\tPROUD MEMBER OF\n\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/era.org\/?wpbdp_sort=field-36\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" itemprop=\"url\">\n\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/era_logo_website_blue_II-300x143-1.png\" alt=\"era_logo_website_blue_II-300x143\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"143\" width=\"300\" title=\"era_logo_website_blue_II-300x143\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 300px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 300\/143;\" \/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.powertensales.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/era_logo_website_blue_II-300x143-1.png\" alt=\"era_logo_website_blue_II-300x143\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"143\" width=\"300\" title=\"era_logo_website_blue_II-300x143\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"  \/><\/noscript>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>customer service is our #1 priority Power10 was started out of a simple desire to bring an added level of customer service and support to our customers. We are excited to be\u00a0partnered\u00a0with manufacturers who make customer service a number one priority! WHAT IS A POWER 10? A Power 10 is a strategic rowing term. It&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-33","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v24.0 - https:\/\/